# The PDA handwriting band under a text page (portrait canvases): the frequency field is written with the band.
# The number written is a SYNTHETIC placeholder.
# fake-scenario: radio
band
title Reticulum: the handwriting band in a text page
sizes 480x800 480x640 800x1280

wait 1500
key down
key down
key enter
wait 300
key down
key enter
wait 500
key down
key down
key down
key enter
wait 500
expect band shown
shot band
check band
write digits 2 0 0
wait 300
shot band-written
key esc
wait 300
key esc
wait 300
expect band hidden
key esc
key esc
key esc
expect quit
